xt":"시스템,","x":1036,"y":1248,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"디렉터리","x":1150,"y":1248,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"및","x":1288,"y":1248,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"데이터","x":1334,"y":1246,"width":91,"height":38},{"text":"블록을","x":1443,"y":1247,"width":100,"height":36}]},{"text":"저장하는 메모리 버퍼와 개시를 관리한다. 버퍼 내의 블록은 대용량 저장장치 블록의 전","words":[{"text":"저장하는","x":297,"y":1311,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":440,"y":1310,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼와","x":550,"y":1311,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"개시를","x":656,"y":1311,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"관리한다.","x":758,"y":1310,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"버퍼","x":905,"y":1309,"width":55,"height":37},{"text":"내의","x":977,"y":1309,"width":57,"height":36},{"text":"블록은","x":1048,"y":1309,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"대용량","x":1153,"y":1309,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"저장장치","x":1259,"y":1308,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"블록의","x":1398,"y":1307,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"전","x":1509,"y":1308,"width":31,"height":35}]},{"text":"송이 일어나기 전에 할당된다. 이 버퍼가 가득 자면, 버퍼 관리자는 요청된 입출력이 완","words":[{"text":"송이","x":296,"y":1371,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"일어나기","x":377,"y":1371,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"전에","x":518,"y":1371,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"할당된다.","x":593,"y":1371,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":742,"y":1370,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"버퍼가","x":785,"y":1370,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"가득","x":889,"y":1370,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"자면,","x":962,"y":1369,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"버퍼","x":1046,"y":1369,"width":57,"height":37},{"text":"관리자는","x":1118,"y":1370,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"요청된","x":1256,"y":1369,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"입출력이","x":1368,"y":1368,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"완","x":1507,"y":1369,"width":35,"height":35}]},{"text":"료될 수 있도록 더 많은 버퍼 메모리를 찾아내거나 버퍼의 가용 공간을 확보해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"료될","x":295,"y":1431,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":374,"y":1432,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"있도록","x":